<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Yaka - Nouveau Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa mioolo kwaa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda wa mioolo kwaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotilili</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wa mioolo wa Pawuli kwaa Timoteo, li na mandaa matsieelele matala tumini a Pawuli tumu a Yiisu Kristo. Pawuli li mu perese (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2.9</ref></char>), na babalayi mu balibuundu bamaabwoongolo nde. Nde ayaaba ti taanga hoolo dimaasaala (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:15">1.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10-16">4.10-16</ref></char>), nde sa akwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">4.6</ref></char>). Nde li mu uha mabweele kwaa Timoteo, mbaayi a nde wa isala, wu nde atoono weti mwaana a nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wu li mu ulibili moonyi mu idiingi kia Pawuli: isala kia nde weti tumu a Yiisu Kristo, nziisili a nde, mapasi ma nde mundaa Ndaa Yimbwe. Mu mukaanda wu, Pawuli li mu uha mandoongi kwaa Timoteo. Nha kati a tsiomi, nde li mu uhamisa Timoteo mu ukaba mapasi ma nde mu isala mu Kristo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Tumake, Pawuli li mu uhamisa Timoteo mu uyaabisa Mandaa ma Nziaambi bubwe-bubwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:15">2.14—4.15</ref></char>). Mu yii, Timoteo afwaana ubata makaama matala bitoolo, nde afwaana mu utee mbisi kwaa babali mu usa bubi, na nde afwaana uduku ndiaatili a Pawuli. Tsiomi a tsiomi, nde afwaana uba wanambita mu nziisili a Pawuli na ya miyiisi mia Kristo mikimi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu taanga di bambaangi ba Yiisu ba tsiomi bali mu udiimbili, babali mu udukusu isala bafwaana mu uduku nziisili a bo. Mu yii, bo bafwaana ukebe <char style="em">nziisili bubwe-bubwe</char> yi bo baholi kwaa miyiisi mia bo. Bo bafwaana ka utaanga Mabasonuu ma Ngira. Mu taanga di basonii mikaanda mio mia mioolo kwaa Timoteo, Mabasonuu ma Ngira ali Lilasina li likulu, na helape, ndaamba a yikimi mu Lilasina li Linyatii. Mandaa Mabasonuu ma Ngira maa moosi, «mali mafwaana mu uyiisi ngwanya, mu usieembe bubi, mu usuungusu mamabi, na mu uyiisi ndiaatili yafwaana, na yi Nziaambi ali mu uloombo» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">3.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Me Pawuli, wuli tumu a Yiisu Kristo, mu litoono la Nziaambi. Nziaambi asooli me mu uyaabisa moonyi wubalasini bisi mu Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Me nitsinduu mukaanda wu kwaa Timoteo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Timoteo </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Biy 16.1</ref></char></note>, mwaana a me wa litoono: Nyaala Nziaambi Taayi na Yiisu Kristo Pfumu a bisi baha we bweese, mbweeyili, na iyeenge!<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli li mu uvutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mundaa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Me nivutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi, wu me ndi mu usalila mu matsimi matsieeme, weti bwasiiri bakaa ba me, mundaa ti me ndi mu uhama mu ukuundu mu we, butsuu na nyanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Me ndi mu ulibili moonyi mu matsanga ma we, mu taanga di diakikabuu. Me ndi na nzala yalaa ya ubwamono we, paa me uluulu mu kinyi. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Me ndi mu ulibili moonyo mu imiini kia ngwanya, ki we li na kio. Ni imiini kiali na kaa a we wa mukaasa Loyisi na nguu a we Enikia, tswaamini a we. Me ndi mu utsimi ti kio ili ka mu we. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Ni mu buu me ndi mu ulibili we moonyi mu yo: bwalulu mbaa ya bungori ba Nziaambi ahi kwaa we, mu taanga di me nanayi mioo nha yulu a we. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Mu ngwanya Muheebili wu Nziaambi ahi kwaa bisi, a ali mu uha bisi boomo pe, ka bunu Muheebili wuu li mu uluusu bisi mu mifuri, mu litoono, na mu kamini a mutimi.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Aba na tsionyi pe mu uta imbaangi mu Pfumu a bisi. Aba ka na tsionyi pe mu me, wuli mu perese mu ndaa nde. Ka siingi umono pasi na me mu ndaa Ndaa Yimbwe, mu usa ilimbisi mu mifuri mi Nziaambi ali mu uha. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Ni nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">Wayobili bisi na wata bisi mu mbili ya ngiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">A uli pe mu ndaa biyiluu bibibwe bi bisi diasi, nde ayilii buu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">ka mu ndaa minhana mia nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:9">na mu bweese ba nde aheeri bisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">Nde amweesi bisi bweese ba nde mu Yiisu Kristo, tswaamina a taanga didihele uwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Nde amweesi bisi bo mu taanga di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:10">mu nziriri a muvuyisi a bisi Yiisu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:10">Ni nde asukusu lituu la likwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:10">na mu Ndaa Yimbwe, amweesi moonyi wu uhele ukwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Nziaambi abiaalisi me mu uyaabisa Ndaa Yimbwe yi, weti muyiisi na tumu a Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Ni mu ndaa yii me ndi mu umono pasi di. Ka me a ndi na tsionyi pe, mundaa ti me nayaaba mu na me na sa imiini. Na, me ndi na ilimbisi ti, nde li na lituu la ukebe bii bi nde aha kwaa me, natee mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Holo weti ifwaani mandaa masuungunu ma me nayaabisa we. Temene na ngwi mu imiini, na mu litoono li bisi dili na lo mu itwaari na Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Kebe mandoongi mamabwe mabaheeri we, mu libaasila la Muheebili wa Ngira wuli mu udiaala mu bisi.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pamini a Onesifora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Weti bu we ayaaba, boosi ba ku itinini kia Asia babwoongolo me, nha kati a bo uli na Pingela na Ermongena ka. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Nyaala Pfumu amweese mbweeyili a nde kwaa likaanda la Onesifora, mundaa ti nde ubaahamisanga me mu mataanga mama mosi. Nde a amoni tsionyi mu me pe, mu mikuru mia me pe. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Ka mu diina taanga di nde atoori ku ngaanda a Looma, nde asiayi me mu nzala yalaa, natee bu nde asiolili me. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Nyaala Pfumu aha nde bweese ba Nziaambi mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi! We ayiluu uyaaba ka libaasila li nde ahi kwaa me bu nali ku ngaanda a Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Lisodare lanambita mu Yiisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ni mu buu, we mwaana me, holo mifuri mia we mu bweese ba bisa-beni, bali mu umata kwaa Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Ma we ayuyi me mu uyaabisa nha kulu a bambaangi balaa, yaabisa mo kwaa baata babutuu usa ilimbisi mu bo, babali ka bo makulu utuu uyiisi kwaa baata babamosi.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Holo ikuku kia we kia mapasi, weti lisodaare lanambata mu Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Lisodare lili kutso isala, a ali mu uduku pe mandaa mahele utala isala kia nde, mbii ti nde tooni umweese kinyi kwaa mukuutu a nde. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Bumosi ka, mudumi-a-matiini utuu pe ubaa musieende, so nde a dumi pe weti buli mikele. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Musiali a matsiee wumaavulu usala isala kia pasi, afwaana uba watsiomi mu uholo ikuku kia mbutu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Tsimi bubwe mu mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele. Yaaba ti, Pfumu sa aha we mayele ma uyaaba mandaa maa moosi.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Libili moonyi mu Yiisu Kristo, mwaana a Daavidi, na wasiimbuu mu babakwa. Maa ni mandaa mali mu uleele Ndaa Yimbwe yi me ndi mu uyaabisa. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Ni mu Ndaa Yimbwe yii, me ndi mu umono pasi. Na, ni mu ndaa yo ka bakutu me misiingi mia bitali weti muyilii a mamabi! Ka a bakutu pe mandaa ma Nziaambi misiingi. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Ni mu buu me ndi mu ukama mutimi mu mioosi, mu ndaa mbweeyili a baa ba Nziaambi asoolo. Me ndi mu uyiluu buu, paa ti bo ka babaa liyobolo lili mu Yiisu Kristo, na buzitu ba bilimi na bilimi. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Mandaa ma mali ma ngwanya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«So bisi dili diakwa itwaari na nde, bisi sa diba ka moonyi itwaari na nde.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>So bisi dihami, bisi sa ditumu ka na nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">So bisi dituni nde, nde ka sa atunu bisi.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>So bisi diahele na imiini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">nde li ahama mu imiini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">Mundaa ti, nde utuu pe utunu mandaa ma nde makulu.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musiali wu Pfumu ali mu usiingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Libili moonyi mu mandaa maa kwaa boosi, na loombo kwaa bo weti bwafwaana nha kulu a Nziaambi, mu unyaala ukaama mu bitoolo bia mandaa. Makaama maa a mali na isala pe, so a ndila mu ufuusu babali mu uyuu mo. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Sa mifuri mu uba muutu wu Nziaambi afwaana usiingi nha misi mia nde, mu uba musiali wahele na tsionyi mu isala kia nde, na wuli mu uyaabisa weti bwafwaana, mandaa ma ngwanya. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Bata mayolo ma ibuu a buu, na batsori: babali mu uyiluu buu bali mu uhama mu masumu. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Nziisili a bo yili weti putu yaboolo, yili mu udia musunyi. Nha kati a bo, uli na mu Imene<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Imene </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Ti 1.20</ref></char></note> na Fileete. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Bo bamaatakuu na ngwanya, na bo bali mu ubwiiisi imiini kia balayi, mu uleele ti tsimbilili a bisi mu babakwa yamaakwayilimi. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Ka bunu, bibwa bia mifuri biasuusi Nziaambi bili biahama. Mandaa maa-na-ma basonuu nha yulu bio: «Pfumu ayaaba baba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:5">Ndi 16.5</ref></char></note>», na: « Pasi muutu wuli mu leele ti nde li wa Pfumu, nyaala a sisi mamabi!».<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Mutso nzo yinene, a uli na ndila bikoombo bibayiluu mu woolo na bia mboongo pe. Uli ka na bio bibayiluu mu miti na mu tumu. Bibayiluu mu woolo na mu mboongo basuusi bio mu mikuungi miminene. Na bibimosi, bia usalila pasi iluumbu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>So muutu tsieemi mu bubi boosi ba me nayaabisa, nde sa aba wubasuusu nha peembi mu toono a pfumu a nde. Nde li na ndutu kwaa pfumu a nde, na ayilimi mu uyiluu mamabwe mu taanga dioosi.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Bata manzala mamabi ma bufuru. Saa libweeye, imiini, litoono, iyeenge na baa bali mu ukuundu Pfumu, mu mutimi watsieeme. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Ka bata bimoo bia buwulu na bia bundimbi: we ayaaba ti mo mali mu ubee makaama. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Ka booyi la Pfumu a afwaana pe mu ukaama. Nde afwaana uba muutu wa buleembi nha kulu a baata boosi, na wutuu uyiisi na uba na kamini a mutimi mu litsoro. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Nde afwaana uyiisi mu buleembi babali mu udwaanisa nziisili a nde. Helape Nziaambi sa aha bo kuulu ya ukiingili mayele na uyaaba ngwanya. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Ni mu buu, bo sa bavutuu mu matsimi ma bo mamabwe, na sa bakuuluu mu mieete mia Saatina, wakaanga bo, na wasuusi bo ku tsini a litoono la nde.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Biluumbu bia tsieelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Libili moonyi bubwe mu ma ndaa ma: mu manini a taanga, sa muba na biluumbu bia pasi. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Mu ngwanya baata sa baba na nyiingi, sa batoono mboongo, sa baba na linaanguu, sa baba na liwaa. Bo sa batuu Nziaambi, na sa batemenene bataayi na banguu ba bo. Bo a butuu pe uvutulu matoondo mu mamabwe, a buba pe na likiinzi mu mandaa mamumata kwaa Nziaambi. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Bo sa baba na mitimi miminono, babahele a ngebe. Bo sa baba weti Saatina mu utsuu mamabi mu baata, sa na uba bangaa kakabi, sa batoono umweese bambaayi pasi na sa baba mitaata mia mamabwe. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Bo sa bayeelele bambaayi ba bo kwaa mitaata, sa baba na ituusi, sa baluulu mu liwaa. Na bo sa bavulu utoono makinyi ma tsi na sa babele Nziaambi. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Bo sa bamweese ti bo bangaa libweeye, ka sa ba bisi litu la Nziaambi. Takuu na baata baa!<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Babamosi nha kati a bo bali mu ukoto mu manzo na bali mu usuusu ku tsini a litumu la bo, bakaasa babali pasi pe mu ufutu, baluulu mu masumu, bali mu usalila manzala ma musunyi ma mupili na mupili. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Bakaasa baa bali mu usaa uyii taanga dioosi, ka a bali mu utuu uyaaba ngwanya pe. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Weti bu Yanesi na Yamberesi bateminini Mooso, bumosi ka, baata ba bali mu utemenene ngwanya. Bo bali na matsimi matekene, na imiini kia bo ili kia ibuu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Ka bo a buto pe la, mundaa ti baata boosi sa bayaaba bundimbi ba bo, weti bwamonii bundimbi ba Yanesi na Yamberesi.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumini dia tsieelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Ka we, we aduki me mu nziisili a me, mu ndiaatili a me, mu minhana mia me, mu imiini kia me, mu mukonono a me, mu litoono la me, mu pamini a me, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>mu kwaamisa a me, na mu mapasi ma me. We ayaaba mandaa moosi mabwiilili me ku ngaanda a Antioki, ku ngaanda a Ikonio, ku ngaanda a Lisitara, na ki pili a kwaamisa me namoni. Ka bunu, Pfumu akuuli me mu mii mioosi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Mu ngwanya, baata boosi batoono ubiti idiingi kianambata mu Nziaambi mu itwaari na Yiisu Kristo sa ba kwaamisa bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Ka baata babali bababi na ba ngaa pia, sa bayene ku la mu uyiluu bubi. Bo sa bafutu baata bakimi, na bo makulu sa bafutu bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ka we, ba wahama na keketee mu maa ma we ayii na asiingi mu ilimbisi kioosi. We ayaaba kwaa ki muyiisi we ayii mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Mu ngwanya, umatuu bungebe ba we, we ayaaba Mabasonuu ma Ngiri. Mo utuu uha we buyeri bali mu ubiti ku liyobolo, mu imiini mu Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Mabasonuu ma Ngira moosi, mamata kwaa Nziaambi na mali mafwaana mu uyiisi ngwanya, mu usieembe bubi, mu usuungusu mamabi na mu uyiisi ndiaatili yafwaana, na yi Nziaambi ali mu uloombo. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Ni mu buu mundaa mo, pasi muutu wuli mu usalila Nziaambi, sa aba wayilimi na wakuu mu usala bubwe mu mandaa moosi.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Me ni ta imbaangi nha kulu a Nziaambi na nha kulu a Yiisu Kristo, wukaafuundusu bamisii na babakwa, wukaamonuu mu Ipfumu kia nde, me nitumu we mandaa ma: <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>So taanga diaba dimbwe, so a buu pe, dimbi, sa mukonono mu uyaabisa mandaa ma Nziaambi. Mweese baata bubi ba bo, sieembe so a buu pe, hamisi na kama mutimi mu nziisili a we. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Mu ndaa ti, taanga sa diyiri di baata a bubwatoono uyuu nziisili ya ngwanya pe. Ka bo sa baduku manzala ma bo mamabi, na kaba la bayiisi sa lidieengelele bo na sa baleele bo ma bo batoono uyuu. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Bo sa ba dibuu matswi ma bo mu uhele uyuu ngwanya, na sa bakiinguu mu uyuu matsaba. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Ka we, ba na izuunu mu mandaa moosi. Kama mutimi mu mapasi. Sala mu mifuri mu uyaabisa Ndaa Yimbwe, na kuusu isala kia Nziaambi natee ku manini.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Mu ndaa yatala me, me namaakwaha nyutu a me yoosi weti bungori kwaa Nziaambi. Na taanga dia uha mabweele kwaa tsi yi diamaato. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Me nadwaani mundiingi wumubwe, me nadumi tee ku manini, na me nakeli imiini kia me! <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Na mu taanga di, musieende a mbiingili li mu ukebe me: ni iburu kia mbiingili kia libweeye, ki Pfumu Mufuundisi wasuungunu, akaaha me mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi. Na, a ndila kwaa me pe nde akaaha kio, ka kwaa baata boosi bali mu ukebe mu litoono, taanga di nde akaamonuu.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawuli li mu uloombo kwaa Timoteo mu uyamono nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Sa mifuri mu uyiri mawasa kwaa me. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Mundaa ti Demasi amaabwoongolo me. Nde avulu utoono mandaa ma tsi yi. Nde amaayene ku Tesalonika. Kesense ayeni ku Ngalatia, na Tito ku Dalmatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Ndili a Luka li na me nha. Yiri na Malako, mundaa ti nde utuu ubaasila me mu isala kia me. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Me natsinduu Tisikusi ku Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Nha we kaayiri, bee me iyungu ki me nasiisi ku ngaanda a Trowasi kwaa Kaposi. Beyi ka mabuuku, na vulu-vulu ma mu mikaanda mia banyama. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alekandere muyilii a bitali amweesi me pasi dialaa. Pfumu sa asieembe nde weti buli bifu bia nde. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>We ka sa mayele mu nde, mundaa ti nde amaatemenene nziisili a bisi mu kakabi.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Muutu pe so mosi wahamisi me mbala yatsiomi yi me natsuyi mu ukala nyutu a me. Boosi babwoongili me. Nyaala Nziaambi asa bo kolokolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Ka Pfumu abaasili me, na nde ahamisi me. Mu yii, me natuyi uyaabisa Ndaa a nde yoosi Yimbwe, na me nayuusi yo kwaa boosi babali pe mu ifuumbu kia Bayuudayo pe. Na nde akuuli me nha munywa a kosi. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Pfumu sa abwakuulu me mu biyiluu bibibi bioosi, na nde sa alooso me peembe-polo mu ipfumu kia nde kia mayula. Nyaala buzitu buba kwaa nde mu bilimi na bilimi! Ameni!<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabwee matsieelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Tooso mabwee ma me kwaa Pirisile na Akila, tumake kwaa baata ba nzo a Onesifora. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erasiti asiaali ku Kolito, na me na siisi Trofimi ku Mileti, mundaa ti nde ali mubeeri. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Sa mifuri mu uyiri tswaamini a taanga dia kioori dito. Ebulusi, Pudense, Linusi, Kolodia na baana banguu bana boosi batsindii we mabwee. <verse eid="2TI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Nyaala Pfumu aba na muwuumu a we! Na nyaala bweese ba Nziaambi buba na beni!<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
